1392
01:30:32,721 --> 01:30:40,898
The baggage counter was managed by an old lady and general store inside the airport had a man in his seventies working behind the counter.

1393
01:30:40,978 --> 01:30:55,130
This pattern continued as I navigated through my trip from the bus driver who took me to the hotel to the concierge at the front desk who was also an older lady and even the bartender and an impeccably dressed man in his later years mixing drinks with finesse.

1394
01:30:55,210 --> 01:31:01,130
Throughout my travels in South Korea, I saw a remarkable level of economic participation from the older generation.

1395
01:31:01,210 --> 01:31:04,433
It wasn't that the country lacked young people, rather,

1396
01:31:04,513 --> 01:31:09,770
